The login story

Write a story called `login` in this order: the `Browser` sends to `Auth` with
the label `password`, `Auth` asks `Users` with the label `check`, and `Auth`
answers the `Browser` with the label `token`. Show it as a sequence.
---
story login {
  Browser -> Auth: password
  Auth -> Users: check
  Auth -> Browser: token
}
show sequence of login
